    },
    {
      "description": "随机读取一篇缓存文章，按指定内容发送到私聊 QQ。只读数据库与配置，不写入任何记录，也不修改配置。",
      "id": "system.send_test",
      "input_schema": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "content_format": {
            "enum": [
              "title",
              "title_link",
              "title_lead",
              "title_body",
              "title_link_lead"
            ],
            "title": "Content Format",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "qq": {
            "pattern": "^[1-9]\\d{4,12}$",
            "title": "Qq",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "qq",
          "content_format"
        ],
        "title": "SendTestInput",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "output_schema": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "destination_id": {
            "title": "Destination Id",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "message_chars": {
            "title": "Message Chars",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "pubdate": {
            "title": "Pubdate",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "sent": {
            "title": "Sent",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "source_id": {
            "title": "Source Id",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "source_name": {
            "title": "Source Name",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": {
            "title": "Title",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "sent",
          "destination_id",
          "source_id",
          "source_name",
          "title",
          "pubdate",
          "message_chars"
        ],
        "title": "SendTestOutput",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "permission": "manage",
      "title": "发送测试"
    }
  ],
  "config": {
    "description": "指令驱动模式下的全部用户可调项。",
    "properties": {
      "cache_days": {
        "default": 10,
        "description": "文章在本地保留的天数，超期文章在下一次请求时立即删除。范围 7 至 30 天。",
        "maximum": 30,
        "minimum": 7,
        "title": "缓存保留天数",
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "content_format": {
        "default": "title_link_lead",
        "description": "每篇文章携带的内容。若源文章没有正文，涉及开头和正文的选项会退化为仅标题。",
        "enum": [
          "title",
          "title_link",
          "title_lead",
          "title_body",
          "title_link_lead"
        ],
        "option_labels": {
          "title": "仅标题",
          "title_body": "标题和正文",
          "title_lead": "标题和开头",
          "title_link": "标题和链接",
          "title_link_lead": "标题、链接和开头"
        },
        "title": "发送内容",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "message_interval_seconds": {
        "default": 2,
        "description": "“所有RSS新闻”按订阅连续发送多条消息时的间隔，范围 1 至 5 秒。",
        "maximum": 5,
        "minimum": 1,
        "title": "多条消息间隔（秒）",
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "per_destination_limit": {
        "default": 50,
        "description": "单次请求最多接收的文章总数，默认 50 篇。低于“订阅数 × 每订阅上限”时，排在后面的订阅可能长期发不出文章。",
        "maximum": 500,
        "minimum": 1,
        "title": "用户接收文章最大数量",
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "per_source_limit": {
        "default": 10,
        "description": "每条订阅每次请求最多发送的文章数，默认 10 篇。",
        "maximum": 100,
        "minimum": 1,
        "title": "每订阅发送文章数",
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "pull_interval_minutes": {
        "default": 120,
        "description": "仅在用户请求新闻时尝试拉取；距该源上次拉取不足此间隔时直接读取缓存。范围 15 分钟至 12 小时，默认 120 分钟。",
        "maximum": 720,
        "minimum": 15,
        "title": "两次拉取最小间隔（分钟）",
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "send_enabled": {
        "default": true,
        "description": "关闭后相当于静音：用户请求新闻时不拉取、不发送文章；RSS 列表和昵称设置仍然可用。",
        "title": "允许发送新闻",
        "type": "boolean"
      }
    },
    "title": "Config",
    "type": "object"
  },
  "guides": [
    {
      "completion_action": null,
      "demo": {
        "config": {
          "cache_days": 10,
          "content_format": "title_link_lead",
          "message_interval_seconds": 2,
          "per_destination_limit": 50,
          "per_source_limit": 10,
          "pull_interval_minutes": 120,
          "send_enabled": true
        }
      },
      "id": "first-use",
      "steps": [
        {
          "chapter": "打开配置",
          "example": {
            "cache_days": 10,
            "content_format": "title_link_lead",
            "message_interval_seconds": 2,
            "per_destination_limit": 50,
            "per_source_limit": 10,
            "pull_interval_minutes": 120,
            "send_enabled": true
          },
          "form": "start",
          "target": "config",
          "text": "在插件管理选择 NeoBot_RSS_News，打开配置表单。这里从公开默认值开始演示，真实配置不会被修改。订阅、简称和发送测试在“插件页面”中管理。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "设置静音开关",
          "example": {
            "cache_days": 10,
            "content_format": "title_link_lead",
            "message_interval_seconds": 2,
            "per_destination_limit": 50,
            "per_source_limit": 10,
            "pull_interval_minutes": 120,
            "send_enabled": false
          },
          "form": "edit",
          "target": "config.send_enabled",
          "text": "关闭“允许发送新闻”后，用户请求新闻时不会拉取或发送文章；RSS 列表和昵称设置仍然可用。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "设置拉取间隔",
          "example": {
            "cache_days": 10,
            "content_format": "title_link_lead",
            "message_interval_seconds": 2,
            "per_destination_limit": 50,
            "per_source_limit": 10,
            "pull_interval_minutes": 30,
            "send_enabled": true
          },
          "form": "edit",
          "target": "config.pull_interval_minutes",
          "text": "插件不再定时拉取，只在用户请求新闻时检查每个源的上次拉取时间。距上次拉取不足此间隔就直接读缓存。范围 15 分钟至 12 小时。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "选择发送内容",
          "example": {
            "cache_days": 10,
            "content_format": "title_body",
            "message_interval_seconds": 2,
            "per_destination_limit": 50,
            "per_source_limit": 10,
            "pull_interval_minutes": 120,
            "send_enabled": true
          },
          "form": "edit",
          "target": "config.content_format",
          "text": "默认发送标题、链接和 200 字开头。若源文章没有正文，涉及开头和正文的选项会退化为仅标题。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "设置每订阅篇数",
          "example": {
            "cache_days": 10,
            "content_format": "title_body",
            "message_interval_seconds": 2,
            "per_destination_limit": 50,
            "per_source_limit": 5,
            "pull_interval_minutes": 120,
            "send_enabled": true
          },
          "form": "edit",
          "target": "config.per_source_limit",
          "text": "每条订阅每次请求最多发送的文章数，默认 10 篇。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "设置用户接收上限",
          "example": {
            "cache_days": 10,
            "content_format": "title_body",
            "message_interval_seconds": 2,
            "per_destination_limit": 80,
            "per_source_limit": 5,
            "pull_interval_minutes": 120,
            "send_enabled": true
          },
          "form": "edit",
          "target": "config.per_destination_limit",
          "text": "单次“所有RSS新闻”请求最多接收的文章总数，默认 50 篇。若订阅数 × 每订阅上限超过此值，插件页面会提示饿死风险。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "设置缓存天数",
          "example": {
            "cache_days": 14,
            "content_format": "title_body",
            "message_interval_seconds": 2,
            "per_destination_limit": 80,
            "per_source_limit": 5,
            "pull_interval_minutes": 120,
            "send_enabled": true
          },
          "form": "edit",
          "target": "config.cache_days",
          "text": "文章在本地保留的天数，超期文章会在下一次请求时立即删除。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": "设置消息间隔",
          "example": {
            "cache_days": 14,
            "content_format": "title_body",
            "message_interval_seconds": 3,
            "per_destination_limit": 80,
            "per_source_limit": 5,
            "pull_interval_minutes": 120,
            "send_enabled": true
          },
